@EcoNexus.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5067

### Health check
GET {{EcoNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Versioned ping
GET {{EcoNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ping
Accept: application/json

### Swagger JSON
GET {{EcoNexus.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
